WEBVTT

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:15.780
Lady Ton.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.030
Miss.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.280
Huh? Guys...

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.750
Um... What am I doing here?

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.790
You don't remember?

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.250
You beat the enemy with incredible power,

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:29.870
but after that you collapsed.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.190
Is that right?

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:34.910
Sorry for all the trouble I caused.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:37.970
Shut up and sleep, you wild woman.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.680
After all the power you used,
 your body must be feeling the effects.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.130
Go ahead and rest.

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:47.560
Hold it right there.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:50.990
First, Ton, listen to this. I've got good news.

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:53.720
Your friend's okay.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:54.320
Huh?

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.150
Turns out Shinyao's alive.

00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:01.120
But in the chaos, 
we lost track of exactly where she is.

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.370
In any case, my brother Chris is with her.

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:05.830
Shinyao's okay.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:08.210
Shinyao?

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:09.260
Yup!

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:12.210
Who is that?

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:51.100
<b>Episode 8 The Price of Power</b>

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.640
Wayne, how's Ton?

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:54.480
She says she's fine, but it 
didn't seem that way to me.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:56.650
So one night's rest didn't do any good.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:01.240
And she seems to have forgotten 
about Miss Shinyao.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:03.800
Why did that happen?

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.200
Who knows?

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.540
Ton lost control last night.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:10.540
It happened because she was 
confronted with her best friend's death

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.790
and drew more power than she 
could handle from the ring.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.460
She was really strong then.

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:22.930
But a human can't control 
that forbidden power.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:25.430
The user suffers some backlash.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:31.690
But why would the caring Ton 
specifically forget her best friend?

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.940
That must be why.

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:39.610
Human brains protect themselves 
by rejecting parts

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:42.700
of themselves after suffering 
severe psychological damage.

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:46.010
For Lady Ton, the loss of Lady Shinyao

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:48.770
must have been a difficult reality to accept.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:54.080
In other words, she's fleeing from reality?

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.150
No.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:04:00.050
More accurately, she's being 
forced to flee from reality.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:01.980
Forced to flee...

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:03.820
...from reality.

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:07.450
It must be hard for her.

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:15.280
I wonder why my body feels so heavy.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.550
I don't have time to be lying around here.

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:23.740
There's something I need to do right now.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:28.200
What is it that I need to do?

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:30.960
I've already enrolled in school.

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:33.310
Should I be managing the café?

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:42.520
I thought it was something 
more urgent and important.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.760
Uh...

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.410
It's no use.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:49.220
I'm too tired to think.

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:56.650
Well, if it really is important, 
I'm sure I'll remember eventually.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:11.910
What should we do now?

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.610
Where'd that come from?

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:18.190
I'm talking about Lady Ton.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:21.000
She should rest for now,

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:25.920
but I was wondering if there's 
anything we can do in the meantime.

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:27.180
Toryu.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:29.970
You must've grown so much 
if you're saying that.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:35.060
Actually, I was just 
wondering the same thing.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:36.570
Me, too.

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:38.230
Gather round, guys.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:42.700
Let's hold the first meeting 
to determine what we'll do about Ton.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:48.760
Cutting to the chase, I have a great idea.

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:52.920
It came to me when I heard 
what Toryu said earlier.

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:55.790
Ton's memory is messed up

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:59.080
because she saw Shinyao killed 
right before her eyes, right?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.440
Based on the situation, I believe so.

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:05.050
But Shinyao's alive.

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:08.360
So Ton just jumped to conclusions.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.010
Yeah.

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:11.380
Then it's easy.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:15.890
Once we tell Ton the truth, 
won't she go back to normal?

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:20.790
What? But didn't that fail when 
you tried it last night?

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:24.450
Nah, we wouldn't give 
such a rough explanation.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.060
We'd take our time.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:30.850
Like showing her photos of Shinyao while 
earnestly explaining the situation.

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:31.990
I see.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:34.160
It's worth a shot.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:40.460
Don't. If she lost her memories, 
leaving her that way is an option.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:44.000
There's no guarantee she'll be 
happier having her memories back.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.840
Maybe, but that's for Ton to decide.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:50.350
You or I shouldn't decide for her.

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:54.010
But this is what happened 
as a result of Ton's choices.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:58.000
She chose to fight and sacrifice herself.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.980
She entered forbidden territory.

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:02.600
Now she's destroying herself.

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:03.770
Shut up!

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:06.890
It's not right for Ton to not be like herself!

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:08.570
If she can be restored, we should do it!

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:10.950
But once her memories return,

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:14.200
Ton will surely leave to 
fight for her friend again.

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:18.550
She'll use her power recklessly and 
be assailed by that backlash again.

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:21.040
Don't you care if that happens to her?

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:24.590
I-If that's what Ton wants, 
then it can't be helped.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:25.900
This is pointless.

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:30.900
In any case, Ton will continue resting.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:33.890
If anything threatens her friend,

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.850
I simply need to hunt every 
last one of them down.

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:43.440
This guy's trying to wrap up this 
discussion like some kind of hotshot.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.950
Hey, don't just stand there.

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:49.030
It's a meeting. Share your opinions with us.

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:52.390
No matter who she is, she's still Lady Ton.

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:56.080
I will simply serve Lady Ton however she is.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:59.290
I don't care as long as I can help her.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:02.330
What kind of equivocal answers are those?

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:05.290
I'm bored.

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:08.750
The café should be open by now.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.380
I bet they're having fun working.

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:29.440
What should we do now?

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.220
Oh?

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:32.530
Is it already time for the second meeting

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.530
to determine what we'll do about Ton?

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:36.490
Let me join.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.870
I told you, it's best 
if we don't do anything.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.720
I have another good idea.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:45.500
I call it...

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:49.250
"Shocking! Super Exciting Surprise Visit!"

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.930
Anyway, I'll be back.

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.720
Wait, Luke.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:01.510
You're the only cook.

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:03.160
You need to stay.

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:06.060
But we're not busy yet.

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:08.730
Your cooking is what attracts 
people to the café.

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:10.210
What? No way.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:13.300
Is that how you feel about me, Vlad?

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:18.120
By the way, I'm taking my break now.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.810
What? We just opened.

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:24.580
Vlad, what if we receive an order for tea?

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:26.490
Do what you can.

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:29.360
It's just pouring hot water over some leaves.

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:30.210
Anyone can do it.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:33.050
That's a 180 from what you normally say!

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:36.290
I'm joking. Have them wait.

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:39.300
My tea is worth that much.

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:42.070
I'm bored.

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:47.560
Ton, are you awake?

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.060
What?

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:50.020
Are you awake?

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.690
Yeah, I am.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:55.440
I see. I'm coming in.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:57.710
What are you doing?

00:09:57.710 --> 00:09:59.070
You should be sleeping.

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:01.590
I was.

00:10:01.590 --> 00:10:05.750
Anyway, I used checking in 
as an excuse to come see you.

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:09.390
Thanks. Wait, excuse?

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:13.190
Your hair color's not back to normal.

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.050
Huh? What?

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.280
But I didn't dye it.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.680
Is there something wrong with it?

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:21.520
No. More importantly...

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:24.340
I'm beat.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:28.640
I wanted to set up a defensive perimeter 
before Luke put any ideas in your head.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:29.860
Shinya—

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:33.590
If I'm not careful, I'll end 
up digging my own grave.

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:35.860
What does that mean? I don't get it.

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:40.320
Ton, no matter what happens, 
don't do anything crazy on your own.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:43.030
You can lean on us.

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:45.290
Sure, thanks.

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:48.210
But I still don't get it.

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:50.210
That's fine for now.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.670
As long as you don't forget that,

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:55.310
the others are right.

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:59.300
I'll stay with you, no matter who you are.

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:00.800
Stay with me?

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:02.890
What's that, a confession?

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:03.740
Yikes.

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:06.480
Silly girl.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:07.850
You're a century too young.

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:15.400
What? Vlad did?

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.030
Yeah. He was sitting 
there until a minute ago.

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:21.480
Damn it. He stole a march
on me. What does he want?

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.910
Ton, did he do anything weird to you?

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:26.870
Absolutely not.

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:28.050
Really?

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.610
He didn't take advantage of the 
confusion to touch your hair?

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:33.750
I don't think so?

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:37.710
Seriously? He's the one who 
said we should leave you be.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.920
Luke? What's wrong?

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:41.480
Nothing.

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:43.930
I know. Can I take a survey?

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:44.640
Sure.

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:48.070
This is a story about a certain girl.

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:49.100
A girl?

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:51.650
What? Are you asking me 
for relationship advice?

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:52.310
No.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:57.320
That girl lost something really 
important, like a treasure.

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:58.970
What kind of treasure?

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:00.530
Well...

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:04.190
Just having it gives her strength.

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:05.620
Something like that.

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:08.010
So it's a wonderful treasure.

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:10.540
I hope it comes back to her someday.

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:15.460
But suppose if she 
ever reclaimed that treasure,

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:18.300
it would bring about misfortune.

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.920
What? I thought you were asking 
for relationship advice.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.760
Is this some kind of fantasy story?

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:27.200
Ton, do you think she should 
reclaim her treasure anyway?

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:31.350
Or should she forget about it 
and live a quiet life?

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:32.840
I don't know.

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:34.730
After all, I'm not her.

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:39.190
Yeah, but then there's no survey.

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:45.070
I don't think she'd want another person 
to assess her happiness, either.

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:49.790
And I still think you're asking 
for relationship advice.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:52.500
I told you, I'm not.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:53.750
Really?

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.330
So you don't like this girl?

00:12:58.270 --> 00:12:59.040
I do.

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:06.140
After all, I'm on the side of 
every lost kitty cat in the world.

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:07.830
Right, right.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.850
I'd almost forgotten this is who you are.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.430
Hey, why do you look so down?

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:16.060
If spending the night 
alone makes you lonely...

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.380
No, thank you.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:26.160
Uh...?

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.280
Thank you for granting me an audience.

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:30.840
Uh, sure. Go ahead.

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:31.500
Huh?

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:32.520
What is this?

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:35.770
Embarrassingly enough, I, Toryu,

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:39.130
have only superficial knowledge 
about visiting a sick friend.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:42.090
Yeah, I'm sure. It's fine.

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:47.470
But I thought hard 
and decided I'd bring these.

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:51.330
This. This is the right answer.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:52.180
Thank you.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:56.890
By the way, Lady Ton, did anything 
happen before I arrived?

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.850
What? Not really.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.650
Your bed is slightly disarranged.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:03.510
It's not... is it?

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:05.610
So is your hair.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:06.680
My hair?

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:09.120
Oh, because I've been lying down.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.820
Cut me some slack today.

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:12.750
No. I shall brush it.

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:14.590
Huh? You don't need to do that.

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:15.920
I've been sweating.

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:17.220
I'll do it myself.

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:17.960
No.

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:19.980
Let me handle it.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:21.600
I know what I'm doing.

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:24.380
Lady Rijan once praised my brushing.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.170
My great-grandmother did?

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:28.050
I see.

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:46.480
What's wrong?

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:47.400
Nothing.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:51.150
I was just renewing my 
understanding of my situation.

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:52.030
What does that mean?

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:55.200
No matter who you are,

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:59.920
I will always have gratitude, 
respect, and love for you.

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:08.120
Today is fun.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:09.680
Everyone's being so nice.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:12.130
I hope it stays like this forever.

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:15.560
But...

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.560
Is that okay?

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.040
Is this really how things should be?

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:25.530
Damn. There's no end to them.

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:26.400
What are they?

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.030
We have far more pursuers 
now than we did before.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:36.700
Where to?

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:39.290
Anywhere. Just drive.

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.280
Sounds like a movie.

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:44.960
Very well. Which way shall we go?

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:46.620
To the end of the world.

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:47.840
Very well.

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:49.050
Let's go.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:06.510
<i>The designated information may have 
been acquired by a synchronized device.</i>

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:11.190
<i>Other functions will not be available 
while verifying the image.</i>

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:11.680
Huh? What's it doing on its own?

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.950
<i>Please wait.</i>

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:13.950
Sorry, sir.

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:17.850
I thought I put it on silent.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:19.910
Synchronized device?

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.240
<i>Verification complete.</i>

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:25.650
<i>91% match.</i>

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:26.900
<i>Highly likely to be the target.</i>

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:27.820
Get down.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.930
<i>Sending information to application developer.</i>

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:30.550
We're getting out. Stop the car.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.160
Already?

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.330
<i>Please do not turn off your phone.</i>

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:36.740
What's gotten into you?

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:38.090
Just go.

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:43.920
That app the whole world 
uses is Snowmary's—

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:46.020
No, Midnight Sun's eyes.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:47.480
What do you mean?

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:50.890
The entire world's watching us.

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.990
How are they getting away?

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:57.330
What? A red light?

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:00.540
The law can be dealt with later.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:01.580
Come on.

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:08.000
Welcome, Mr. Haysin.

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:11.800
What happened? You're badly injured.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.920
Did Little Miss Whatever-liu Ton beat you up?

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:19.010
I see. You seem to have a lot of eyes.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.880
But let me warn you.

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:25.850
When you gaze into the abyss, 
the abyss gazes back at you.

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:28.390
Know your place.

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:34.070
Come on. If I didn't, I'd have 
become your boss long ago.

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:38.030
Why was I suddenly summoned here?

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:44.130
I wanted to show you some 
interesting footage I just got.

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:48.930
Requesting assistance.

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:51.800
Backup, requesting assistance.

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:01.100
It burns. It burns, Vlad Garfunkel.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:06.580
The blood you allowed to survive 
has become disgraceful hell fire.

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.810
It burns me.

00:18:09.300 --> 00:18:11.690
Long live... humanity...

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:14.580
Well? Interesting, right?

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:17.010
Is this what's popular these days?

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:17.600
Yup.

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:21.370
The young always have such 
complicated sensibilities.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:21.990
Huh?

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:24.650
Oh, no.

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:29.480
This is the "Major Scoop: Hilarious 
Epilogue of Finished Characters."

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:31.460
Don't look at that monitor. Look at this one.

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:35.800
I found this valuable video 
while checking the data.

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:36.810
Oh?

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:38.010
Isn't this crazy?

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.140
Isn't she incredible?

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:41.860
Mu Shinyao.

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:44.350
To think she has such special powers.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:46.650
I found this.

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:52.460
Who will grow up to be stronger: 
her or your beloved Ton?

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.570
Let's play a game.

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:04.870
It's them.

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:07.330
We're not safe here anymore.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:09.330
Damn. Where should we go?

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:12.420
What's so funny?

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:13.700
Oh, it's not that.

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:18.300
That pumpkin just wished me luck.

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:20.130
Huh? He did what?

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:22.930
Let's go.

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:25.760
Yeah, sure. Where, though?

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:28.170
There's no place left for us to go.

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:29.480
There is.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.170
We still have hope.

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:33.360
Ton and her friends.

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:35.320
Café Forbidden.

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:40.310
But I caused huge problems for them.

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:43.610
That'd be asking too much.

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:44.530
It's okay.

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:46.980
I'm sure they've forgiven you.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:55.580
Whenever I was in trouble, 
Ton would always come to save me.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:57.460
Let's have her save us.

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:03.300
That's right. I...

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:04.720
That's right.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:07.510
I don't have time to dream here alone.

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:13.680
Come again.

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:24.530
Miss, you can't go out. You need to rest.

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:33.120
Lady Ton.

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:35.290
You're looking good, miss.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:36.840
You're finally yourself again.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:39.800
Yeah. Thanks, guys.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.220
Thanks to you, I'm completely recharged.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:44.260
You're up early.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:45.540
Are you sure you're okay?

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:50.300
There's a reason I have to get up.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:51.560
Yeah.

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:00.940
Good morning, everyone.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.730
I'm going to go rescue Shinyao.

00:22:35.160 --> 00:23:34.930
<b>Phantom 
Twilight Plus</b>

00:22:35.920 --> 00:22:37.370
Phantom in the Twilight Plus!

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:41.340
This time we're discussing Ton's situation.

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:43.040
Dear Lady Ton.

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:46.830
Tossed about by a mysterious power, 
her hair turned red, and her memory's foggy.

00:22:47.460 --> 00:22:49.390
If only I could, I'd take her place.

00:22:49.390 --> 00:22:51.100
You seem to be acting different.

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:55.550
That aside, Ton's power is a type of magic.

00:22:55.550 --> 00:22:58.520
The same type as that Haysin man's power.

00:22:58.520 --> 00:23:02.810
Magic can be described as a power that 
temporarily turns humans into Umbra.

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:05.470
If you use it too much, 
you'll become an Umbra.

00:23:05.810 --> 00:23:07.780
Oh, dear Lady Ton.

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:12.590
Normally using such a power requires 
a powerful will and intense training,

00:23:12.590 --> 00:23:16.660
but in Ton's case she omitted 
that process by using Rijan's ring.

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:20.010
Lady Rijan created that ring.

00:23:20.010 --> 00:23:23.290
I've heard it's a type of object 
that automatically uses magic.

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:26.210
In other words, only Rijan 
should be able to use the ring.

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:27.290
You truly do value expedience.

00:23:27.290 --> 00:23:28.330
It's one of my powers.

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:30.520
Laugh and call it expedience all you want.

00:23:31.610 --> 00:23:33.030
Don't actually laugh.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:50.070
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:37.220
Ton has regained her powers and memories.

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:41.020
Meanwhile, Shinyao continues 
to flee aimlessly with Chris.

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:43.070
They enjoy a moment of calm

00:23:43.070 --> 00:23:46.570
as though quietly accepting 
the fate that awaits them.

00:23:46.570 --> 00:23:48.860
Next time: The Pursued and The Protector.

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:50.070
<b>Episode 9 The Pursued and The Protector</b>
